              <td class=3D"text-left" rowspan=3D"1" colspan=3D"1">Reserved.=
 Network Computing System (NCS) backward compatibility, and
              includes Nil UUID as per <a href=3D"https://www.rfc-editor.or=
g/rfc/rfc9562.html#niluuid" class=3D"auto internal xref">Section 5.9</a>.</=
td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"text-left" rowspan=3D"1" colspan=3D"1">1</td>
              <td class=3D"text-left" rowspan=3D"1" colspan=3D"1">0</td>
              <td class=3D"text-left" rowspan=3D"1" colspan=3D"1">x</td>
              <td class=3D"text-left" rowspan=3D"1" colspan=3D"1">x</td>
