tml#table2" class=3D"auto internal xref">Table 2</a> lists all of the versi=
ons for this UUID variant 10xx specified in this document.<a href=3D"https:=
//www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9562.html#section-4.2-2" class=3D"pilcrow">=C2=
