<section id=3D"appendix-A.1">
        <h3 id=3D"name-example-of-a-uuidv1-value">
<a href=3D"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9562.html#appendix-A.1" class=
=3D"section-number selfRef">A.1. </a><a href=3D"https://www.rfc-editor.org/=
rfc/rfc9562.html#name-example-of-a-uuidv1-value" class=3D"section-name self=
Ref">Example of a UUIDv1 Value</a>
        </h3>
<span id=3D"name-uuidv1-example-test-vector"></span><figure id=3D"figure-16=
">
          <div class=3D"alignLeft art-text artwork" id=3D"appendix-A.1-1.1"=
>
<pre>-------------------------------------------
field      bits value
-------------------------------------------
time_low   32   0xC232AB00
time_mid   16   0x9414
ver         4   0x1
